"Un homme heureux","overview":{"value":"Mentre Jean, un conservatore, fa campagna per essere rieletto sindaco di una piccola città nel nord della Francia, Edith, sua moglie da 40 anni, gli rivela un segreto che non può più reprimere: in cuor suo, lei è - ed è sempre stato - un uomo. All'inizio Jean pensa che stia scherzando, ma capisce subito che Edith è determinata alla transizione. Sia il suo matrimonio che la sua campagna stanno per subire un serio cambiamento.","language":"it-IT"},"releaseDate":"2023-02-15","status":"Released","rating":5.4,"ratingCount":128,"genres":["Commedia"],"countries":["France"],"facts":{"Runtime":"98m"},"keywords":[],"networks":[],"socialLinks":{},"cast":[{"id":28255,"name":"Fabrice Luchini","role":"Jean Leroy","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/krR5EUfM13UJwsB07ffzPU7FXYR.jpg"},{"id":20080,"name":"Catherine Frot","role":"Eddy Leroy","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pi1HwK9gJfhkDJkC3SCDJgDc9LS.jpg"},{"id":119501,"name":"Philippe Katerine","role":"Francis","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vGo21vRILgGPT5Q3TTwzLxANemF.jpg"},{"id":1562548,"name":"Artus","role":"Thomas","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/78eYMroV3AyRJDqijnp0FSLPCgZ.jpg"},{"id":1075115,"name":"Bastien Ughetto","role":"Pierre Leroy","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6zeyplgO0ijOXrJ3KwAEdfT4AlS.jpg"},{"id":2865630,"name":"Paul Mirabel","role":"Luc Leroy","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9sWCXSsRoON7x2AJUk9LnmQM8R5.jpg"},{"id":1826078,"name":"Agnès Hurstel","role":"Marie Leroy","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/f1mq1z7L6uz1O0nAXOMOf8rQCqf.jpg"},{"id":2104222,"name":"Camille Le Gall","role":"Carole","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tEovqXEeLJUYrviowvgOmoX5fJd.jpg"},{"id":1408199,"name":"Grégoire Bonnet","role":"Gérald","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fJuJ4PNqu7HuRRtDXlwqDOHXL4W.jpg"},{"id":1336030,"name":"Thomas VDB","role":"Le charcutier","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8eGEk7cI7ZGrxOi6vdexZtMt9SX.jpg"},{"id":3443770,"name":"Jason Chicandier","role":"Dufour","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/18VK2dkzsIQv16YwvIi3LVgZ5TW.jpg"},{"id":2088961,"name":"Haroun","role":"Cédric Levasseur","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hQMhIVmld4bvXRnx2yH3ZNC4auo.jpg"},{"id":1357722,"name":"Laëtitia Eïdo","role":"L'endoctrinologue","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6AOHS2h4sei7Aq8IqBbXo4o5uGw.jpg"},{"id":2934508,"name":"Luigi Kröner","role":"Mika","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uDy7JwC6o7buxzPWiBUcC2gab1Q.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Un uomo felice","overview":"Mentre Jean, un conservatore, fa campagna per essere rieletto sindaco di una piccola città nel nord della Francia, Edith, sua moglie da 40 anni, gli rivela un segreto che non può più reprimere: in cuor suo, lei è - ed è sempre stato - un uomo. All'inizio Jean pensa che stia scherzando, ma capisce subito che Edith è determinata alla transizione. Sia il suo matrimonio che la sua campagna stanno per subire un serio cambiamento."},{"language":"en-US","title":"For Better and for Worse","overview":"Jean has been the conservative mayor of a small town for several years. He intends to run for another term. Edith, his wife, is the paragon of the traditional devoted housewife and mother. So it comes as quite a shock when she tells her husband of forty years that deep down, she has always been... A MAN! Totally blindsided, Jean didn't see this coming. For a politician campaigning on family values, this is too much! But Edith, still the loving wife, make a deal with him: she will postpone her transition and stay a woman until after the elections. But as we know, campaigns are all about digging up dirt to keep the rumor mill turning"},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Alors que Jean, maire très conservateur d'une petite ville du Nord, est en campagne pour sa réélection, Édith, sa femme depuis quarante ans, lui annonce une nouvelle qu’elle ne peut plus taire… Au plus profond de son être, elle est - et a toujours été - un homme. Jean pense d’abord à une plaisanterie mais réalise rapidement qu’Édith est sérieuse et déterminée à mener sa transition jusqu’au bout. Il comprend alors que son couple, mais aussi sa campagne électorale, risquent d’être sacrément chamboulés…"}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jpls67jWYCzHSHfL2SXA0FqaOoW.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jpls67jWYCzHSHfL2SXA0FqaOoW.png","language":"fr","width":2032,"height":1209},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nhrkKFVermEz08PDlvRVlQafvaW.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nhrkKFVermEz08PDlvRVlQafvaW.png","language":"fr","width":486,"height":292}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/x0MPd5Ege5ceNqb4QbRJVvEbitq.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/x0MPd5Ege5ceNqb4QbRJVvEbitq.jpg","language":"it","width":500,"height":750},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hxBJnMOfESBWV5lo6ZanL0rsECV.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hxBJnMOfESBWV5lo6ZanL0rsECV.jpg","language":"fr","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jgwwvYHiNlzETpofFVWD6YgIYJT.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jgwwvYHiNlzETpofFVWD6YgIYJT.jpg","language":"fr","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oAqboHimgnlVQfTx913hdqzHiP8.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oAqboHimgnlVQfTx913hdqzHiP8.jpg","language":"fr","width":1200,"height":1600},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eDevT48wlaolbd7LH1Ovb84q3CJ.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eDevT48wlaolbd7LH1Ovb84q3CJ.jpg","language":"fr","width":1200,"height":1600},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmd